  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Object distance,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1.9</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>190</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math></p><p>Focal length,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math></p><p>Magnification,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>190</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Therefore,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mn>200</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Image velocity,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>I</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>40</mn></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>I</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>0.1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Magnitude of velocity&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>",
